  m_Name: Carta_HospitalRegional
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Hospital Regional
  _titleEn: Regional Hospital
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Um hospital regional concentra cirurgias, UTI e especialistas que munic\xEDpios
    pequenos n\xE3o conseguiriam manter sozinhos."
  _summaryEn: A regional hospital concentrates surgery, intensive care and specialists
    that small municipalities could not maintain alone.
  _realWorld: "A Lei 8.080, de 1990, organiza o SUS de forma regionalizada: cidades
    vizinhas dividem hospitais e se organizam, muitas vezes, em cons\xF3rcios."
  _realWorldEn: 'Law 8,080 of 1990 organizes Brazil''s public health system by region:
    neighboring cities share hospitals and often form consortiums.'
  _tradeOffs: "Manter um hospital custa por ano boa parte do que custou constru\xED-lo,
    e pacientes de longe dependem de transporte."
  _tradeOffsEn: Running a hospital costs, every year, a large share of what it cost
    to build, and distant patients depend on transport.
  _sources:
  - Label: Lei 8.080/1990 (Planalto)
    Url: https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/leis/l8080.htm
